# Pairs with RevocationTakesEffect. A copy written over the committed record
# instead of joined with it lets a stale approval reinstate a revoked grant.
# The offer, approval and revocation it overtakes plus its own write need a
# fourth write.
MODULE: CommitOverwritesJoin
TARGET: RevocationTakesEffect
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a copy read before later writes overwrites the committed record instead of joining it
PERTURBS: CommitCall
BOUNDS: MaxWrites = 4

--- FIND
    /\ Commit(fl.verb, fl.caller, fl.auth, fl.present, fl.preActive, fl.cp, Merge(grant, fl.cp), fl.target)
--- REPLACE
    /\ Commit(fl.verb, fl.caller, fl.auth, fl.present, fl.preActive, fl.cp, fl.cp, fl.target)
--- END